   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《桌面破壞神：掛機 ARPG》將暗黑式刷寶體驗與桌面掛機放置玩法相結合。輕鬆放置，自動下本刷寶、收穫戰利品、升級強化，讓你的角色逐漸成長為傳奇英雄。無盡的怪物，閃耀的掉落，層層的Boss挑戰，在「掛機」與「變強」的循環之中橫掃一切敵人，體驗「輕鬆掛機，持續成長，越刷越強」的放置型暗黑玩法。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/c5f5ea7bb484a0ba7f7bf36345f8dc74.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >無論是強化武器所需的&quot;金幣和材料&quot;，還是提升英雄等級所需的&quot;經驗值&quot;，又或者是打造終極神裝的&quot;稀有掉落&quot;，只需一鍵規劃，英雄便會自動刷怪、拾取、成長。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/ea542687423da6091da116fe8c3800a0.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >桌面破壞神中的所有敵人，甚至是 Boss，都可以被捕獲！你的僕從會拉著戰利品車，自動為你拾取滿地的戰利品，讓刷怪永不停歇；它們也會在戰鬥中支援你：有些提供被動增益，有些則能釋放特殊技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/023d638c85d85aeadcc7cc22ac0c8003.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向三大主城投資你的冒險財富，完善城鎮的冒險配套，將城鎮從歇腳點發展成為你刷寶路上的最強輔助。隨著進度推進，解鎖鐵匠鋪、鍊金商人、神秘商人，甚至是連結其他冒險者的拍賣行。解鎖不同的 NPC 與服務，開啟更多變強之路。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/a80ad42ff7760155af50bce5e72a9e63.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掛機刷到的極品神裝但不適合自己的角色？在 Steam 市場中與其他玩家交易珍貴的裝備、材料和隨從，自由定價、市場浮動，打造屬於冒險者的流通經濟。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/06c30f8382734a3c76aec279fac97b2e.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在終極挑戰、限時試煉和不斷攀升的難度層級中考驗你的英雄。獲取更稀有的裝備和資源。隨著英雄等級的提升，是挑戰更高層的秘境，還是刷取更極品的裝備？又或是研究更強大的技能組合，以擊敗傳說級的終極BOSS？通向終點的旅途無窮無盡。</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《桌面破壞神：掛機 ARPG》將暗黑式刷寶體驗與桌面掛機放置玩法相結合。輕鬆放置，自動下本刷寶、收穫戰利品、升級強化，讓你的角色逐漸成長為傳奇英雄。無盡的怪物，閃耀的掉落，層層的Boss挑戰，在「掛機」與「變強」的循環之中橫掃一切敵人，體驗「輕鬆掛機，持續成長，越刷越強」的放置型暗黑玩法。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/c5f5ea7bb484a0ba7f7bf36345f8dc74.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/9b012cb28cfc1626d32a108147c8364d.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >無論是強化武器所需的&quot;金幣和材料&quot;，還是提升英雄等級所需的&quot;經驗值&quot;，又或者是打造終極神裝的&quot;稀有掉落&quot;，只需一鍵規劃，英雄便會自動刷怪、拾取、成長。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/ea542687423da6091da116fe8c3800a0.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/3394227e914321ada997e5d7e70f24e3.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >桌面破壞神中的所有敵人，甚至是 Boss，都可以被捕獲！你的僕從會拉著戰利品車，自動為你拾取滿地的戰利品，讓刷怪永不停歇；它們也會在戰鬥中支援你：有些提供被動增益，有些則能釋放特殊技能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/023d638c85d85aeadcc7cc22ac0c8003.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.poster.avif?t=1792185184\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.webm?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/2ddb102acea71293d270461a78eb2a99.mp4?t=1792185184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向三大主城投資你的冒險財富，完善城鎮的冒險配套，將城鎮從歇腳點發展成為你刷寶路上的最強輔助。隨著進度推進，解鎖鐵匠鋪、鍊金商人、神秘商人，甚至是連結其他冒險者的拍賣行。解鎖不同的 NPC 與服務，開啟更多變強之路。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/a80ad42ff7760155af50bce5e72a9e63.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掛機刷到的極品神裝但不適合自己的角色？在 Steam 市場中與其他玩家交易珍貴的裝備、材料和隨從，自由定價、市場浮動，打造屬於冒險者的流通經濟。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623570/extras/06c30f8382734a3c76aec279fac97b2e.avif?t=1792185184\" width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在終極挑戰、限時試煉和不斷攀升的難度層級中考驗你的英雄。獲取更稀有的裝備和資源。隨著英雄等級的提升，是挑戰更高層的秘境，還是刷取更極品的裝備？又或是研究更強大的技能組合，以擊敗傳說級的終極BOSS？通向終點的旅途無窮無盡。</p>",
   "short_description": "受《暗黑破壞神》系列啟發，以放置玩法還原經典暗黑式刷寶體驗，無論工作還是休閒，隨時掛機刷副本。選擇四種不同職業，探索兩片大陸三大主城，不斷刷取極品裝備、積累財富、構築流派，將角色打造成傳奇英雄。",
   "supported_languages": "英文, 法文, 德文, 西班牙文 - 西班牙, 日文, 韓文, 波蘭文, 葡萄牙文 - 巴西, 俄文, 簡體中文, 繁體中文, 泰文, 土耳其文",
